flowchart TB
    accTitle: Brook transport and execution authority
    accDescr: Transport adapters expose their durability capabilities. One local execution authority coordinates admission, work state, outbox and recovery; generic sinks report external effect outcomes.
    backend["Transport adapters<br/>Ephemeral / local disk / future Kafka"]
    ingress["Generic producer boundary<br/>Identity + admission acknowledgement"]
    authority["Shared local execution authority<br/>Dedup / leases / state / outbox / quotas"]
    delivery["Graph-node and result deliveries<br/>Agent work + correlation records"]
    sink["Generic sink boundary<br/>Evidence + uncertain-effect recovery"]
    backend --> ingress
    ingress --> authority
    authority --> delivery
    delivery -->|authorized effect admission| sink
